<!-- Instructor Signing -->
<section class="bg-slate-50 dark:bg-navy-900 py-16 lg:py-24">
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <img src="/images/feature-instructor-signing.png" alt="NinerLog flight detail page showing a completed instructor signature, locked flight banner, and crew entry" class="rounded-xl shadow-xl w-full order-last lg:order-2" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="675" />
      <div class="reveal lg:order-1">
        <span class="freq-badge mb-4">
          <span class="inline-block w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-blink"></span>
          NEW &bull; TRAINING-READY
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-800 dark:text-white mb-4 mt-3">Instructor Signing</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Training flights need an instructor&rsquo;s signature &mdash; and going digital shouldn&rsquo;t make that harder than paper. With NinerLog, your instructor signs the flight right on your phone after the debrief, or later from their own device through a secure signing link. Once signed, the entry is locked against edits, so your training record stays exactly as your instructor endorsed it.
        </p>
        <ul class="space-y-3">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><strong>Sign on the spot.</strong> Hand over your phone &mdash; the instructor draws their signature and adds their name and certificate number</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><strong>Or request it remotely.</strong> Email a secure signing link, or share a link or QR code &mdash; the instructor signs from any device, no account needed</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><strong>Links expire on your terms.</strong> Valid from 24 hours to 30 days &mdash; resend or cancel a pending request any time</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><strong>Signed means locked.</strong> The signature &mdash; name, certificate number, and date &mdash; appears on the flight, which can no longer be edited</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-emerald-500 mt-0.5 shrink-0" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>
            <span class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300"><strong>Void with an audit trail.</strong> Need to fix a typo? Void the signature with a documented reason &mdash; the flight unlocks and a fresh signature is required</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

